BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Florida Project
DTSTART:20250904T010000Z
DTEND:20250904T031500Z
DTSTAMP:20250904T010000Z
UID:jORvnGHgO2
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 115 mins (1h55m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club Warm\, winning\,
  and gloriously alive\, Sean Baker’s The Florida Project is a deeply mov
 ing and unforgettably poignant look at childhood.  Introduced by SIFF Cin
 ema Lead Hari Chitturi.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/siff-m
 ovie-club/the-florida-project
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Roses
DTSTART:20250904T235000Z
DTEND:20250905T015500Z
DTSTAMP:20250904T235000Z
UID:YGGOZlnxu7
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nBenedict Cumberbatch and Olivia 
 Colman play a picture-perfect married couple who descend into a bitter cat
 -and-dog divorce battle in this reimagining of The War of the Roses. Conta
 ins several sequences with flashing lights that may affect those who are s
 usceptible to photosensitive epilepsy or have other photosensitivities.\n\
 nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-roses
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
